OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 19, stabbed in large fight
OL,4,Aoutside music venue
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are investigating after a man
OL,7,Fwas stabbed during a large street fight
OL,8,Fin Nottingham.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police was called to
OL,11,FIremonger Road shortly after 02:30 GMT
OL,12,Fon Friday, to reports of a large
OL,13,Fdisturbance outside The Nest music
OL,14,Fvenue.
OL,16,FThe victim, 19, was taken to hospital
OL,17,Fwith injuries that are not believed to
OL,18,Fbe life-altering or life-threatening.
OL,20,FDet Insp Ian Smith said officers were
OL,21,Fcarrying out inquiries including going
OL,22,Fthrough CCTV footage.
